      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Australian Asthma Conference provided a timely forum for rethinking research priorities and strategies at a time when the Australian government is undertaking major national health policy reviews. Until now, asthma has been a national health priority in Australia, and at the conclusion of the conference, delegates issued a strong statement in support of asthma continuing to be a national health priority in Australia."},
